(text "TFT power: fit jumper 1-2 for protected 5V OR 2-3 for Teensy 3.3V.\nFit ONE jumper shunt only. Remove power before changing. Default: no shunt.\n3.3V option: verify total external load stays within 250mA." (at 80.01 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "97f905a0-781e-48c7-b663-99646127bcfa"))
